/etc/apt/sources.list

These are the repositories we can fetch software from. Add more as you like. deb-src is to enable source pull.

deb http://mirror.anl.gov/pub/ubuntu hardy main
deb-src http://mirror.anl.gov/pub/ubuntu hardy main
deb http://mirror.anl.gov/pub/ubuntu hardy universe
deb-src http://mirror.anl.gov/pub/ubuntu hardy universe


After changing this file, apt-get update and you're ready to go!!

