Sometimes you can get apt cannot process because this package is in an inconsistent state warning... very annoying

https://askubuntu.com/questions/88371/apt-synaptic-needs-to-reinstall-package-but-cant-find-the-archive-for-it

Follow the link here and delete the package like this


sudo rm -i /var/lib/dpkg/info/packagename*
sudo dpkg --remove --force-remove-reinstreq packagename


version 2:

sudo dpkg -i --force-overwrite /var/cache/apt/archives/python-problem-report_2.0.1-0ubuntu9_all.deb
Then run:

sudo apt-get -f install

